	  GENERATE_INFOPLIST_FILE = YES synthesizes Info.plist from INFOPLIST_KEY_*
	  build settings, but that mechanism only recognizes Apple's own well-known
	  keys — arbitrary keys like Sparkle's are silently dropped, confirmed by a
	  local build. Setting INFOPLIST_FILE alongside GENERATE_INFOPLIST_FILE
	  merges this file's keys into the generated plist instead, which is what
	  gets these two through.
	-->
